rategic possibilities are endless. Players must use their analytical skills and strategic thinking to outmaneuver their opponents, create defensive lines, use angles to their advantage, harness momentum, and even sacrifice a marble when necessary. The game is accessible to players of all skill levels, yet offers endless depth and complexity for those who crave a true challenge.\n\nWith a simple and intuitive interface, players can easily customize their settings, select their preferred marbles, board, frame, and sumito to fit their style, and get into the game with ease.\n\nWith easy-to-learn mechanics, challenging gameplay, and endless strategic possibilities, Abalone is a game that you won't want to put down. Download now and start your Abalone adventure!", "trackCensoredName": "Abalone®", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 0, "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/abalone/id6444700609?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "averageUserRating": 0, "minimumOsVersion": "16.0", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN", "FR", "DE", "IT", "JA", "PL", "PT", "RU", "ZH", "ES", "TR"], "fileSizeBytes": "218907648", "formattedPrice": "￦6,600", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 0, "trackContentRating": "4+", "primaryGenreName": "Games", "primaryGenreId": 6014, "trackId": 6444700609, "trackName": "Abalone®", "sellerName": "Plug In Digital", "releaseNotes": "Removed the first agreement screen about sharing device ID for ad campaigns\nBug fixes and optimizations", "bundleId": "com.pid.abalone", "userRatingCount": 0}]}